<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-11-16T22:24:02.706Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 22:24:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese Armed Forces have seized Al-Khuwai and five additional areas in West Kordofan and are advancing toward Al-Nahud while deploying reinforcements to the Blue Nile front, intensifying pressure on the Rapid Support Forces. The RSF continues drone strikes on civilian populations and power stations, plunging cities into darkness and causing civilian casualties, including children. A Rapid Support Forces field commander has defected to the SAF and a former RSF adviser was released in Chad, while a former Sudanese information minister was attacked in Uganda. Humanitarian assistance is deteriorating, with food aid cut for 900,000 people and famine risk rising. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiUEFVX3lxTE44WmQwQWpCeThjNFlJbjNud2lLQ0xYdEE4bGd1eVlodFMzNzZnX1NFSk5rLUZvOHdESkJLanN5RS00NVdOR2xTUUNBOXRqSTFp?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sudan Tribune&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPSjdjbWFQVUdNMnloWndaMlh1LThUVmViZnhmcGZVSFhobWZhV3dtbFV0T3FmYk9sYmlfbDhhZ3BOQ1J1Y2UxUUllUTRyTWRzeVNXVlFJV2daZ3phUVJlNi1ZZVpRUjJfUDlPanMzcUZLRWRtRmRCZnZGUXg2b05fdjRZMWJOUmdMcGsxTUlZMHdGR3ZuQ3o2Y01sb1NYTUp5QVRVLW1QelA1T012U2c?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News PK&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE1pMGRNU3ZLUFVuMDU4RXRPUUlhNzhtUUoxUE1mQTJSMENIeGl4RjcxeVJfSGZoX2FrSVNZM1RJbW4wUHowaV9VQ29vUUU0UF9kVWZKSQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Yemen Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://ne